    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LORETTA: People around here wouldn't know talent if it bit 'em in the Danglies. Where you gotta go is Des Moines. They got karaoke bars where you can…\nALI: Loretta-- when I get out of this butt-hole of a town, I sure as shit won't be heading for Des Moines. She hops up onto the bar, spins around…",
      "LORETTA: You were real good to her, Ali.\nALI: No, she was good to me. She rearranges the flowers resting on the plot, fixing it up.\nALI: And she wasn't even my real Nanna.\nLORETTA: What...?",
      "ALI: I'm not here to work. I'm leaving.\nLORETTA: You are?\nALI: Yeah.",
      "NIKKI: Didn't your Mama tell you it's not polite to stare?\nALI: Sorry, you're just -- so DAMN beautiful.",
      "TESS: You were off the whole second half.\nALI: So, I was spot on the first half? Tess narrows her eyes at Ali. Then looks over at Nikki, Coco and Georgia. Georgia gives an effusive THUMBS…\nTESS: Oh, you're gonna be such a pain in my ass. Ali tries hard not to beam--\nALI: Do I have the job, or not?"
    ]
  },
